Used in src/tools/exchange-calendars.js (the market-calendar tool). Taken
from the project's calendar definitions for XLON, XTKS, XHKG and XNYS:
  - session hours: XLON 08:00-16:30; XTKS 09:00-11:30 and 12:30-15:30;
    XHKG 09:30-12:00 and 13:00-16:00;
  - half days: XLON closes 12:30 on 24 and 31 December (the preceding
    Friday when that day falls on a weekend); XHKG closes 12:00 on the
    weekday eves of Christmas, New Year and Lunar New Year;
  - XTKS year-end closures on 31 December and 2 and 3 January;
  - XNYS early closes at 13:00 on 3 July when it is a Monday to Thursday,
    on the day after Thanksgiving, and on 24 December when it is a Monday
    to Thursday.
Changes: the rules were restated as JavaScript data and functions; no code
of the project is included.
